The paper’s first decisive fact is already clear: it is primarily an algebraic tractability paper, not a construction of hard random RCSP instances. I’m now checking whether its ordered-partial-Maltsev algorithm yields a legitimate Track B “mechanical route versus compact route” family, and whether the paper supplies a path construction—not merely a reachability decision.
