+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Theorem 3.8 gives O(n^2 m |D|^2) greedy descent, while this "
+        "LEQ specialization admits Kahn topological elimination in O(n+m); at "
+        "the shipping preset the latter scans thousands of constraints (the "
+        "exact measured operation and wall-clock counts are in selftest_report), "
