STEP 0 supports a build, but only on Track B. Section 2 gives the exact Hamming-distance-one solution graph; Lemma 3.13 puts min-closed LEQ constraints under the ordered partial Maltsev operation; Lemma 3.7 and Theorem 3.8 give greedy monotone descent and an \(O(n^2m|D|^2)\) reachability algorithm. The shipping specialization has an even stronger \(O(n+m)\) topological algorithm (4,051 measured operations), versus a 166-operation modular-invariant route. I’ve also strengthened canonicalization to cover endpoint reversal and Boolean complementation, not just variable relabeling.
